; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180 wave 1A; REBUILT sl-0187+0188): Boomerang
; Veil — grade 2, nebula pool. PLACEHOLDER id. BEHAVIOURAL family
; (sl-0188): FLANKER — a REPOSITIONER: circles at the wide band and
; SURGES mid-fight (phase speeds 2.0/3.0/2.4) while the curtains fly
; out and back (never a CHASER — the one-room corner-trap law
; holds). hp 800 = 40s at the g2 spine (sl-0187: 20-60s INTENSE;
; cooldowns compressed ~x0.7). One lead per pattern; elite amber;
; every number [T]; GATE 7 owns the length.

